for *pe/lopos nh=sos,
the Peloponnesus, now
the Morea, Hhymn., etc.

as Subst.
that which surrounds, as
the rim of a shield, Eur.;
the string that runs round the top of a net (cf. e)pi/dromos), Xen.;
a gallery running round a building, id=Xen.

Causal, to denote the object
about or
for which one does something:

of Manner,
in what way? how? Od., etc.; ph= dh/;
how tell me? id=Od.; ph= ma/lista;
how exactly? Plat.:also in indirect questions, e)karado/keon to\n po/lemon kh= a)pobh/setai Hdt., etc.

ph= me/n . . , ph= de/ . . ,
on one side . . , on the other . . , Plut.;
partly . . , partly . . , Xen.

Mid.
to make manifest, Il.;
to tell of, disclose, Hom., Hes.

c. gen. rei,
a larger share of a thing, Arist.;
gain made from a thing, Dem.

