e)k pollou=
from a great distance, Thuc.;
for a long time, v. e)k II. 1.

of Value,
how much? Ar.; po/sou;
for how much? at what price? Lat. quanti? id=Ar.; so, e)pi\ po/sw|; Plat.

which of a number? Lat. quotus? po/ston dh\ e)/tos e)sti\n o(/te cei/nissas e)kei=non;
how many years is it since . . ? Od.:in indirect questions, po/stw| me/rei
with how small a part, Xen.

interrog. adv., in direct or indirect questions, corresponding to the relat. o(/pou,
where? Lat. ubi? Hom., etc.:c. gen. loci, pou= gh=s; pou= xqono/s;
where in theworld? Lat. ubinam terrarum? Aesch., etc.; so, pou= pot' ei)= frenw=n; Soph.; pou= gnw/mhs ei)=; Id=Soph..; pou= tu/xhs;
at what point of fortune? Id=Soph.

the treatment of a subject, id=Plat.;
a treatise, Arist.;
an historical work, systematic history, Polyb., Luc.

to take the first place, be best, Soph.:c. gen.
to rank before, take precedence of others, pr. tw=n pollw=n Plat.;
to rule over, *)olu/mpou pr. Soph.

an approach, of
the foot of a mountain, Anth.;
the mouth of a river, id=Anth.

a servant, Soph., Eur.;
